{"seq":3,"slug":"test-architecture-patterns","title":"测试架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/foundations/test-architecture-patterns","wordCount":983,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试架构模式\">测试架构模式</h1><p>E2E 测试代码和产品代码一样需要工程化设计——随着用例数量从 10 增长到 500，没有架构的测试代码会变成无人敢碰的&quot;测试遗留系统&quot;。本篇聚焦经过实践验证的架构模式，让测试套件可维护、可扩展、可理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>四层架构</strong>：测试用例层（验证什么）→ 业务流程层（多步操作序列）→ 页面对象层（单页面交互）→ 基础设施层（运行时能力）</li>\n<li><strong>Fixture 模式</strong>：依赖注入在测试领域的实现，测试声明需要的资源，框架负责创建和清理</li>\n<li><strong>AAA 模式</strong>：Arrange（准备）→ Act（执行）→ Assert（验证），每个测试的标准结构</li>\n<li><strong>关注点分离</strong>：UI 变化只改页面对象层，流程变化只改流程层，测试用例层只在验收标准变化时改动</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分层架构概览\">分层架构概览</h2><p>成熟的 E2E 测试代码库通常分为四层，每层职责单一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[测试用例层 Test Cases] --&gt; B[业务流程层 Flows/Actions]&#10;    B --&gt; C[页面对象层 Page Objects]&#10;    C --&gt; D[基础设施层 Infrastructure]\">graph TD\n    A[测试用例层 Test Cases] --&gt; B[业务流程层 Flows/Actions]\n    B --&gt; C[页面对象层 Page Objects]\n    C --&gt; D[基础设施层 Infrastructure]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测试用例层</td>\n<td>描述&quot;验证什么&quot;</td>\n<td>随需求变化</td>\n<td><code>test(&#39;用户可完成购买流程&#39;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务流程层</td>\n<td>封装&quot;多步骤操作序列&quot;</td>\n<td>随流程变化</td>\n<td><code>checkout(cart, payment)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面对象层</td>\n<td>封装&quot;单页面交互&quot;</td>\n<td>随 UI 变化</td>\n<td><code>loginPage.signIn(user)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施层</td>\n<td>提供&quot;运行时能力&quot;</td>\n<td>几乎不变</td>\n<td>浏览器配置、报告、重试机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种分层的核心价值：当 UI 改动时，只需修改页面对象层；当业务流程改动时，只需修改流程层；测试用例层只在验收标准变化时才需要改动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目录结构设计\">目录结构设计</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tests/&#10;├── e2e/&#10;│   ├── specs/                    # 测试用例（按功能域组织）&#10;│   │   ├── auth/&#10;│   │   │   ├── login.spec.ts&#10;│   │   │   └── registration.spec.ts&#10;│   │   ├── checkout/&#10;│   │   │   ├── cart.spec.ts&#10;│   │   │   └── payment.spec.ts&#10;│   │   └── search/&#10;│   │       └── product-search.spec.ts&#10;│   ├── flows/                    # 业务流程封装&#10;│   │   ├── auth.flow.ts&#10;│   │   └── checkout.flow.ts&#10;│   ├── pages/                    # Page Object&#10;│   │   ├── login.page.ts&#10;│   │   ├── product.page.ts&#10;│   │   └── checkout.page.ts&#10;│   ├── fixtures/                 # 测试数据与 Fixture&#10;│   │   ├── users.ts&#10;│   │   └── products.ts&#10;│   ├── helpers/                  # 工具函数&#10;│   │   ├── api.helper.ts&#10;│   │   └── db.helper.ts&#10;│   └── playwright.config.ts      # 框架配置\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── e2e/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── specs/                    # 测试用例（按功能域组织）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── auth/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   ├── login.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── registration.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── checkout/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   ├── cart.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   │   └── payment.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── search/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │       └── product-search.spec.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── flows/                    # 业务流程封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── auth.flow.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── checkout.flow.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── pages/                    # Page Object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── login.page.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── product.page.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── checkout.page.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── fixtures/                 # 测试数据与 Fixture</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── users.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── products.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── helpers/                  # 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   ├── api.helper.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   │   └── db.helper.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── playwright.config.ts      # 框架配置</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"命名约定\">命名约定</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件类型</th>\n<th>命名规则</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>测试文件</td>\n<td><code>&lt;功能&gt;.spec.ts</code></td>\n<td><code>login.spec.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>页面对象</td>\n<td><code>&lt;页面&gt;.page.ts</code></td>\n<td><code>checkout.page.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务流程</td>\n<td><code>&lt;流程&gt;.flow.ts</code></td>\n<td><code>auth.flow.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具函数</td>\n<td><code>&lt;领域&gt;.helper.ts</code></td>\n<td><code>api.helper.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试数据</td>\n<td><code>&lt;实体名&gt;.ts</code></td>\n<td><code>users.ts</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fixture-模式\">Fixture 模式</h2><p>Playwright 的 Fixture 机制是依赖注入在测试领域的实现——每个测试声明自己需要什么资源，框架负责提供和清理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// fixtures/auth.fixture.ts&#10;import { test as base } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;import { LoginPage } from &#39;../pages/login.page&#39;;&#10;&#10;type AuthFixtures = {&#10;  loginPage: LoginPage;&#10;  authenticatedPage: Page;&#10;};&#10;&#10;export const test = base.extend&lt;AuthFixtures&gt;({&#10;  loginPage: async ({ page }, use) =&gt; {&#10;    const loginPage = new LoginPage(page);&#10;    await use(loginPage);&#10;  },&#10;  authenticatedPage: async ({ page }, use) =&gt; {&#10;    // setup: 通过 API 登录获取 token&#10;    const storageState = await apiLogin(testUser);&#10;    await page.context().addCookies(storageState.cookies);&#10;    await use(page);&#10;    // teardown: 自动清理&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// fixtures/auth.fixture.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { test </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { LoginPage } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '../pages/login.page'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuthFixtures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  loginPage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  authenticatedPage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">extend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AuthFixtures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  loginPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> loginPage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoginPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(loginPage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  authenticatedPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // setup: 通过 API 登录获取 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> storageState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> apiLogin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(testUser);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> page.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addCookies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(storageState.cookies);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> use</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(page);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // teardown: 自动清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Fixture 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>隔离性</strong>：每个测试获得独立的资源实例</li>\n<li><strong>声明式</strong>：测试只声明需要什么，不关心如何创建</li>\n<li><strong>可组合</strong>：Fixture 之间可以相互依赖，形成依赖图</li>\n<li><strong>自动清理</strong>：<code>use()</code> 之后的代码自动作为 teardown 执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"配置管理模式\">配置管理模式</h2><p>E2E 测试需要管理多套配置（不同环境、不同浏览器、不同运行模式）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// playwright.config.ts&#10;import { defineConfig, devices } from &#39;@playwright/test&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default defineConfig({&#10;  testDir: &#39;./specs&#39;,&#10;  retries: process.env.CI ? 2 : 0,&#10;  workers: process.env.CI ? 4 : undefined,&#10;  reporter: [&#10;    [&#39;html&#39;, { open: &#39;never&#39; }],&#10;    [&#39;junit&#39;, { outputFile: &#39;results/junit.xml&#39; }],&#10;  ],&#10;  use: {&#10;    baseURL: process.env.BASE_URL ?? &#39;http://localhost:3000&#39;,&#10;    trace: &#39;retain-on-failure&#39;,&#10;    screenshot: &#39;only-on-failure&#39;,&#10;    video: &#39;retain-on-failure&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  projects: [&#10;    { name: &#39;chromium&#39;, use: { ...devices[&#39;Desktop Chrome&#39;] } },&#10;    { name: &#39;firefox&#39;, use: { ...devices[&#39;Desktop Firefox&#39;] } },&#10;    { name: &#39;webkit&#39;, use: { ...devices[&#39;Desktop Safari&#39;] } },&#10;    { name: &#39;mobile&#39;, use: { ...devices[&#39;iPhone 14&#39;] } },&#10;  ],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// playwright.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineConfig, devices } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@playwright/test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  testDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./specs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retries: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workers: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span>